	<ThingDef ParentName="BaseUnmodifiedPrimaWeapon"> <!--no counterpart, so will be based off S. Launcher-->
		<defName>ET_PrimaSapLauncher_Hypersap</defName>
		<label>prima hypersap launcher</label>
		<description>A sap launcher that has had it's glowsap contents replaced with hypersap. The globs of hypersap are quite acidic, causing burns that can get progressively worse.
\n\nHypersap reacts severely with flesh and armor, burning and corroding it as if the sap were acid. In direct comparison to other sap launchers, it is quite effective in combat.
\n\nThis weapon is entirely organic; it has a limited lifetime and will eventually expire, but can be easily regrown. Note that the very nature of a sap launcher allows it's sap to be infinitely swapped out at a Terravat.</description>
		<graphicData>
